*Adapted and extended from P. Larson, "Principles of MRI" (MIT License), chapter "Volumetric Imaging".
Changes: added symbol table, slice-offset and interleaving numerics, Bloch-simulated slice profiles and a cross-talk model, slice ordering, 3D k-space and FOV/resolution in $z$, slab aliasing simulation, a step-by-step derivation and Monte-Carlo check of the $\sqrt{N_z}$ SNR gain, an equal-time SNR-efficiency comparison, reformatting/isotropic resolution demo, an engineering note and a comparison table. The original's $T_{active}$ is called $T_{slice}$ here, and the floor operation in $N_{slices,max}$ is made explicit.*
